ted install_mac_arm64.sh script for the mac-arm64 platform\n  * Updated patch to fix unused warning as error issue\n  * Added section for Darwin/Mac-arm64 to package-system/astc-encoder/build_config.json to call the new scripts\n  * Added `astc-encoder-3.2-rev5-mac-arm64` into package_build_list_host_darwin-arm64.json`\n\n* Add definition for ISPCTexComp-36b80aa-rev1-mac-arm64\n  * Added mac-arm64 specific patch for ISPCTexComp to explicitly set the arch to aarch64 and target tp neon-i32x4\n  * Updated ISPCTexComp/build_package_image.py to detect and support mac-arm64\n  * Added `ISPCTexComp-36b80aa-rev1-mac-arm64` into package_build_list_host_darwin-arm64.json`\n\nSigned-off-by: Steve Pham <82231385+spham-amzn@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-01-27T16:54:07Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/o3de/3p-package-source/commits/9bb9a108b606b1157df1541ac733fbba01a3a621","html_url":"https://github.com/o3de/3p-package-source/commit/9bb9a108b606b1157df1541ac733fbba01a3a621","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/o3de/3p-package-source/commits/9bb9a108b606b1157df1541ac733fbba01a3a621/comments","author":{"login":"spham-amzn","id":82231385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMjMxMzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82231385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn","html_url":"https://github.com/spham-amzn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u